230	   * Returns a string that can be used to parse an equivalent {@code CacheBuilderSpec}. The order
231	   * and form of this representation is not guaranteed, except that reparsing its output will
232	   * produce a {@code CacheBuilderSpec} equal to this instance.
233	   */
